var SKIP={'model':1,'prompt':1,'planning':1,'memory':1,'retrieval':1,'citation':1,'dataset':1,'vector':1,'chatbot':1,'streaming':1,'deployment':1,'latency':1,'benchmark':1,'bias':1,'sandbox':1,'orchestrator':1,'tracing':1,'inference':1,'parameters':1,'attention':1,'api':1};var MATCHERS=null;function buildMatchers(){MATCHERS=[];(CFG.terms||[]).forEach(function(t){var slug=t[0],label=t[1];if(SKIP[slug])return;var forms=[];var main=label.replace(/\s*\(.*?\)\s*/g,' ').replace(/\s*\/.*$/,'').trim();if(main.length>=3)forms.push(main);var paren=label.match(/\(([^)]+)\)/);if(paren&&/^[A-Z][A-Za-z-]{1,8}$/.test(paren[1])&&paren[1].length>=3)forms.push(paren[1]);if(/^[A-Z]{2,}$/.test(main))forms=[main];forms.forEach(function(f){var cs=/^[A-Z]{2,}/.test(f);MATCHERS.push({slug:slug,term:t,re:new RegExp('\\b'+f.replace(/[.*+?^${}()|[\]\\]/g,'\\$&').replace(/\s+/g,'\\s+')+(cs?'':'s?')+'\\b',cs?'':'i')});});});MATCHERS.sort(function(a,b){return b.re.source.length-a.re.source.length;});}
var pop=null,popFor=null;function closePop(){if(pop){pop.hidden=true;if(popFor){popFor.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');popFor.focus({preventScroll:true});}popFor=null;}}
